The Horizon Gate Hotel is a hotel on the [[Geography/Black and White/Plaza|plaza]] in the [[Geography/Black and White/index|Black and White]], boarded up with a speaker on a pole outside. A caught sound poured into the speaker turns the boards to air and opens the entrance.

Inside are a lobby with a reception desk and a hallway of rooms, and speakers set in the walls, each playing a piece of music. Powering a speaker opens one passage through the building and seals another, and the entryway closes behind whoever comes in. The Party crossed rooms 101, 102 and 103, moving the sounds in the [[Phenomena/Voice Box|voice box]] between the speakers until the front door opened again.
